descriptions.job-0kea5ni:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;HladdPLXIoNz4nxkqkCuk4rAs8v&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XCikdRR2xoZIjdxtCKcuOflrs8d&quot;&gt;Established in 2018, Bybit is one of the world’s leading cryptocurrency exchanges and digital financial platforms, serving over 80 million users across more than 200 countries and regions. Powered by world-class technology and a user-first mindset, Bybit delivers a seamless ecosystem across trading, payments, wealth management, custody, institutional services, and Web3 — connecting users to the future of digital finance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IF06dI0MPoBwYfxbZ4zui13HsoC&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X5EbdOwvMoYuOmxQBbuueUEDsDd&quot;&gt;Our core values define how we build. We listen, care and improve to create products and experiences that put users first. Backed by a global team of ambitious builders, problem-solvers, and innovators, we foster a high-performance and fast-moving environment where talent is empowered to drive real impact at the global scale. Supported by 24/7 multilingual customer service and a strong commitment to innovation, we are shaping the future of finance through technology, collaboration, and bold execution.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LtVud2dO7oglqJxxZoOucqjJsPc&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RMHkdm4bPo66l3xMVO8ui1o8sle&quot;&gt;Today, Bybit is recognized as one of the most trusted and transparent platforms in the digital asset industry, continuing to expand its global presence while building the infrastructure for the next generation of financial services.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;VYBpdZ8aHofzdax6wbIuLUKcsfd&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-BvNXd878GopzGMxSuG1u3GVNsVf&quot;&gt;Role Overview&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VEsHdHUGxoyQKvxbkFyuxPVMsNb&quot;&gt;Own growth-oriented product operations and strategy for the platform&#39;s core products, driving user trading through product mechanism optimization, content &amp;amp; community capabilities, segmentation, and personalized (1:1) product experiences and operating mechanisms — anchored on user lifecycle KPIs across signup, KYC, first deposit, first trade, active/repeat, dormancy, and winback.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot; old-record-id-JIAWdfSX1ooBYMxlctKu5fIisHg&quot; data-type=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-Eaidd4GbtoY0AVx3m3IucVY0sqg&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;list-number1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TGOddjDXFojFYqxSbjXuGqejs2b&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own Lifecycle OKRs&lt;/strong&gt;: Deliver against eFTD/eFTT conversion, retention, resurrection rate, and user Net LTV. Set stage-specific operating strategies and growth cadences.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AT2ndjtKToTkhZxoAiouuQThsAh&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Segmentation &amp;amp; Journey Design&lt;/strong&gt;: Build a segmentation framework based on user attributes, behavior, and lifecycle stage (new / active / dormant / churned / high-value). Design and ship end-to-end User Journeys covering onboarding, first-deposit nudging, engagement, dormancy prevention, and winback.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G0G1dXqbaoRipcxYA2aulE1nsbh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personalization at Scale (1:1)&lt;/strong&gt;: Build a granular segmentation and tagging system based on user attributes, behavior, lifecycle stage, and preference. Deliver personalized recommendations and differentiated strategies across product content, tasks, perks, incentives, and messaging so each user sees what&#39;s relevant to them.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TA2rdqLMVomGl6xFBsauVXfKsJN&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stage-Specific Interventions&lt;/strong&gt;: Design and ship lifecycle programs for activation, engagement/habit-building, high-value cultivation, dormancy prevention, and winback — each solving the core problem of its stage.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O2R4dl4NMoV63Jxis66uFcdds5g&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Mechanism Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;: Lead the design and iteration of trading-driving product mechanisms — task systems, tiering, perks/rewards, content and community (e.g., ByX).&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Qea6dAxydoryTwxeqoJuyeTNsbf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; Experimentation&lt;/strong&gt;: Track D1/D7/D30 retention, FTD conversion, repeat rate, and Net LTV; run independent analysis with AI; validate strategies and mechanisms through A/B testing.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ECZGdzQ99o3FjCx3MzAutBgTsF6&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;: Work with Product, Data, Marketing, Algorithm, and regional teams to embed lifecycle and personalization strategies into product and operating plans.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-Fd2qdbr3ho5LMbx1LMxulTfOsah&quot;&gt;Requirements&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Hb1Mdum30oHfr9x4llPur9EssRe&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;3+ years in growth or product operations, with quantifiable growth results;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GocQd9WeroxD2pxO0naupRVEs0d&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Deep understanding of the user lifecycle and growth funnel, with the ability to design scalable operating mechanisms;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DZKgdALzKosYPlxe7VrudpBdsbd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong data-driven decision making, with a track record of shipping into production;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QI8ddovHZoPkXNxKoNJuE3lps1c&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fluent English; able to drive execution in a global team environment;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V5JLdgFagofz9NxnEi1ua4LnsIh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Hands-on data analysis and A/B testing experience; clear reasoning and strong execution;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-R0PXdnhROo2IA3x5iGPuz5k7sJf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Trading platform, financial, or FinTech product operations / growth background preferred;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DpHNdn1Ntoh2o8xsTPDuRulrsoe&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Community operations experience at comparable competitor products preferred.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Bybit, we are committed to fostering a supportive and enriching work environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Our benefits include:&lt;br&gt;- Study Growth Fund: We support your professional development and continuous learning.&lt;br&gt;- Internal Events: Participate in regular team-building activities, workshops, and events designed to promote collaboration and innovation.&lt;br&gt;- Global Collaboration: Be part of a diverse, international team, working alongside colleagues from around the world.&lt;br&gt;- Career Advancement: Access opportunities for growth and advancement within a rapidly expanding global company.&lt;br&gt;- Internal Mobility: Grow with us- Your long-term development is important to us. We offer internal job opportunities to help build your career path.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-0q776e6:
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is a technology company that builds economic infrastructure for the internet. Businesses of all sizes—from new startups to public companies like Amazon and Salesforce—use our software to accept online payments and run technically sophisticated financial operations in more than 100 countries. By helping businesses accept payments from anywhere in the world and accelerating the economic shift from offline to online, we aim to increase the GDP of the internet.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe’s Leadership Recruiting Team (LRT) is a high-performing group of strategic and creative problem solvers. We are passionate about finding and hiring the very best leaders and experts from around the globe to help drive the next arc of Stripe’s growth.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will be directly responsible for partnering with senior stakeholders to identify, attract, assess, and hire individuals for leadership roles across the company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategically partner with executives to hire top talent for Stripe’s highest priority leadership roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define, design, and implement recruiting processes and search engagements for a variety of senior leadership roles. This includes understanding and mapping the talent landscape, internal calibration and referrals, and matching those data points with the external talent supply&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage end-to-end leadership-level searches from inception of candidate contact to onboarding, including research, outreach strategies, candidate experience, negotiations, partnering with HR for successful onboarding, and communicating with stakeholders along the way&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional partners, such as People Partners, Compensation, and Business Leads, to align hiring goals with business needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop competency-based interviews that surface a candidate’s full range of capabilities, explore their aspirations, and gain insight into how their experience will apply to a leadership role at Stripe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster trust-based relationships with candidates, gaining a close understanding of their requirements and concerns. Serve as a skilled problem solver, facilitator and coach in final negotiations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize team-wide systems and tools to capture current market, client, and candidate information to facilitate both the search process and market intelligence initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to a team that values creative ideas and constant improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a contributing member of the recruiting team that effectively embodies and promotes the culture and values of Stripe. A quick guide to Stripe’s culture is located&lt;a href=&quot;https://stripe.com/jobs/life-at-stripe&quot;&gt; here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years proven executive search experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in identifying, engaging, and closing senior-level passive candidates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding sourcing skills and ability to think ‘outside the box.’&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering with team and hiring managers, including the executive team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior use of talent market insights and data to influence decisions within the leadership groups and cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated track record of building working relationships with leaders and cross-functional partners - we value a Users First approach to executive search, ensuring a positive experience for candidates and hiring managers alike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evidence of creating and maintaining positive candidate experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to distill complex information into a consumable and organized format with a focus on content, tone, and structure - we value Craft and Beauty across all of our outputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to take ownership and effectively manage time and process across roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in both search firms and in-house&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

descriptions.job-11g8z1a:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Plume&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Plume, we believe that technology isn&#39;t about moving faster, it&#39;s about making life’s moments better. Which is why we’ve built the world&#39;s first, and only, open and hardware-independent service delivery platform for smart homes, small businesses, enterprises, and beyond. Our SaaS platform uses WiFi, advanced AI, and machine learning to create the future of connected spaces—and human experiences—at massive scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We now deliver services to over 60 million locations globally and have managed over 3 billion devices on our platform. We’re expanding rapidly, pioneering a new category, and we achieved our Series F funding in just four years. Our customers include many of the world&#39;s largest Internet Service Providers (ISPs) who look to Plume to help them evolve their smart home offerings while gleaning insights from their own data.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;With a bias for action and a love for being trailblazers, the team at Plume embodies a combination of relentless curiosity and imaginative innovation. We challenge ourselves to think in ways that other companies don&#39;t, work to do what should be done (rather than what can), and if we can’t do it exceptionally well, we don’t do it. It’s how we&#39;ve assembled a team of world-class builders, thinkers, and doers. And it’s how we’re reinventing what’s possible every day.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a work-from-office / In-Office role based in our Hyderabad, India location.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Core Engineering builds the firmware and cloud platform that Plume&#39;s next-generation architecture is built on. We deliver the Plume Firmware Agent (PFA) across three reference platforms — &lt;strong&gt;RDK-B&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;prplOS / prplMesh&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;OpenWRT / OpenSync&lt;/strong&gt; — The highly scalable cloud core manages a fleet of connected devices over standards-based protocols.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We&#39;re hiring an Engineering Manager to lead one of Core Engineering&#39;s delivery teams. This is a hands-on-adjacent people-leadership role: you own the health, growth and output of a team of roughly 10-30 firmware, backend and QA engineers, and you are close enough to the technology to make real calls on scope, sequencing and trade-offs.&lt;br&gt;You will not be the only voice in the room. Core runs with technical leads, TPMs, product owners and QA leads across multiple regions, and the manager who succeeds here is the one who makes that distributed system work.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage, coach and grow a globally distributed team of firmware, cloud and QA engineers; run 1:1s, career development, performance and compensation cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own hiring for your team end to end — sourcing partnership, interview loop design, closing, and onboarding that gets new engineers productive on a complex embedded + cloud stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a culture where code review, design review and demos are collaborative rather than transactional — our review norms deliberately keep PRs open for cross-region input, and that only works if managers protect it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive sprint planning, review, demo and retrospective for your team on the CORE board; keep the backlog groomed, parented and honestly estimated.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take quarterly product requirements through grooming into epics and stories, in partnership with Product Management, Product Owners and the TPM — and push back early when scope, dependencies or capacity don&#39;t add up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own release readiness for your area across Alpha, Beta and GA: entry/exit criteria, blocker triage, validation coverage, and a clear-eyed status your leadership can act on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and unblock cross-team dependencies with Product Engineering, Integration Engineering, Cloud/CSS, DevOps and InfoSec.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own technical direction with your leads&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with technical leads and architects on platform strategy — the move from a stateful, driver-coupled OpenSync design toward stateless, standards-compliant, SDK-conformant operation over USP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make and defend architectural trade-offs across three device platforms and the cloud services above them, including what gets upstreamed versus carried downstream.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise the engineering bar on the things that quietly decide velocity: build times, branch hygiene, test automation, flaky testbeds, and observability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years in software engineering with 3+ years managing engineers directly, including hiring and performance management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical grounding in &lt;strong&gt;embedded Linux networking&lt;/strong&gt; — Wi-Fi/networking firmware, an embedded build system (Yocto/OpenWrt/OpenEmbedded), C, and debugging on real hardware — &lt;strong&gt;or&lt;/strong&gt; in &lt;strong&gt;distributed cloud services&lt;/strong&gt; with genuine fluency in the device side.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ownership of a release train: you have shipped firmware or platform software into production at scale; with QA and release gates you were accountable for.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading a &lt;strong&gt;distributed team across time zones&lt;/strong&gt;, and the operating discipline that requires — written communication, asynchronous decision-making, and deliberate inclusion of remote colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort operating in a matrixed organisation with technical leads, TPMs and product owners you influence but don&#39;t manage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience with one or more of &lt;strong&gt;RDK-B&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;prplOS/prplMesh&lt;/strong&gt;, or &lt;strong&gt;OpenSync/OpenWrt&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;Broadband Forum TR-369 (USP) and TR-181&lt;/strong&gt;, and/or &lt;strong&gt;Wi-Fi Alliance EasyMesh&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in the CPE / broadband gateway ecosystem — ODM and chipset vendor SDKs, operator certification, interop testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the surrounding toolchain: Jenkins, GitHub-based workflows, Artifactory, containerised services, Kubernetes/EKS, MQTT, PKI and certificate management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with test automation for embedded systems (e.g. Boardfarm, TDK, cloudless test harnesses) and with managing QA as a first-class discipline rather than an afterthought.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to Wi-Fi 6/6E/7, MLO, and mesh performance work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Plume&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;As the creator of the only open, hardware-independent, cloud-controlled experience platform for ISPs and their subscribers, Plume partners with over 400 ISP customers, including some of the world’s largest such as Charter, Liberty Global, and J:COM.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Using OpenSync, the most widely supported open-source, silicon-to-cloud framework for smart spaces, Plume’s software-defined network allows ISPs to decouple their service offerings from hardware and rapidly curate and deliver new services over a multi-vendor, open-platform architecture.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Plume is an equal opportunity workplace that maintains a continuing policy of nondiscrimination in all employment practices and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;decisions, ensuring equal employment opportunities for all qualified individuals without regard to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;race, color, creed, religion, sex, national origin, age, physical or mental disability, sexual &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;orientation, gender identity, marital status, pregnancy, childbirth or related individual conditions, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;medical conditions (as defined by state law), military or veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local law. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-11zv0wu:
&lt;p&gt;Since we opened our doors in 2009, the world of commerce has evolved immensely, and so has Square. After enabling anyone to take payments and never miss a sale, we saw sellers stymied by disparate, outmoded products and tools that wouldn’t work together.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;So we expanded into software and started building integrated, omnichannel solutions – to help sellers sell online, manage inventory, offer buy now, pay later functionality,&amp;nbsp; book appointments, engage loyal buyers, and hire and pay staff. Across it all, we’ve embedded financial services tools at the point of sale, so merchants can access a business loan and manage their cash flow in one place. Afterpay furthers our goal to provide omnichannel tools that unlock meaningful value and growth, enabling sellers to capture the next generation shopper, increase order sizes, and compete at a larger scale.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Today, we are a partner to sellers of all sizes – large, enterprise-scale businesses with complex operations, sellers just starting, as well as merchants who began selling with Square and have grown larger over time. As our sellers grow, so do our solutions. There is a massive opportunity in front of us. We’re building a significant, meaningful, and lasting business, and we are helping sellers worldwide do the same.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Square, we’re re-imagining how mid-market businesses grow. As an&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Account Executive&lt;/strong&gt; on our SMB Market Team, you’ll bring Square’s ecosystem to new sellers across diverse industries by building, shaping, and closing your own pipeline. You’ll run sophisticated, multi-product deals from the first touch to final close — blending hunter instincts, consultative depth, and strategic execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re an experienced closer who thrives in outbound environments, loves solving meaningful business challenges, and consistently delivers against ambitious targets — this is your role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the full outbound sales cycle&lt;/strong&gt; — from prospecting to negotiation to close — with SMB merchants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and manage a high-quality pipeline&lt;/strong&gt; through cold outreach, social selling, targeted campaigns, and creative outbound strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop multi-product solutions&lt;/strong&gt; across Square’s ecosystem and tailor them to each merchant’s unique needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner with Business Development&lt;/strong&gt; on lead flow while independently driving net-new logo acquisition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conduct high-impact discovery, demos, and negotiations&lt;/strong&gt; with decisiveness across multi-stakeholder deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Act as a consultant and trusted advisor&lt;/strong&gt; — seamlessly flexing across BDR, AE, and AM responsibilities when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally&lt;/strong&gt; with Product, Marketing, Implementation, and Operations to deliver cohesive solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintain disciplined pipeline management&lt;/strong&gt; and forecasting accuracy in Salesforce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consistently hit and exceed revenue goals&lt;/strong&gt; — monthly and quarterly.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1-2 years of full-cycle B2B sales experience&lt;/strong&gt; with consistent quota achievement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven success in outbound prospecting&lt;/strong&gt; and net-new business creation (SaaS or fintech preferred).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience closing complex, multi-threaded deals&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ability to build pipeline from scratch&lt;/strong&gt; using targeted, strategic outreach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exceptional communication, presentation, and negotiation skills&lt;/strong&gt; across phone, video, and written channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong consultative selling skills&lt;/strong&gt; — diagnose business challenges and map tailored solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A hunter’s mindset&lt;/strong&gt; — resilient, creative, and driven to win.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ability to work independently&lt;/strong&gt; while contributing to a team-first environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced proficiency with Salesforce&lt;/strong&gt; and modern sales tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BA/BS degree or equivalent experience&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Guidelines&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates may submit up to 9 active applications within a 60-day period. Reapplications to the same role are accepted 90 days after a previous application has been reviewed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of AI in Our Hiring Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We may use automated AI tools to evaluate job applications for efficiency and consistency. These tools comply with local regulations, including bias audits, and we handle all personal data in accordance with state and local privacy laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contact us &lt;a href=&quot;https://privacy.block.xyz/privacyportal/form&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;with hiring practice or data usage questions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Every benefit we offer is designed with one goal: empowering you to do the best work of your career while building the life you want. Remote work, medical insurance, flexible time off, retirement savings plans, and modern family planning are just some of our offering.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://block.xyz/employee-benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://block.xyz/documents/benefits.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Check out our other benefits at Block.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Block, Inc. (NYSE: XYZ) builds technology to increase access to the global economy. Each of our brands unlocks different aspects of the economy for more people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Square&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;makes commerce and financial services accessible to sellers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Cash App&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is the easy way to spend, send, and store money.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Afterpay&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is transforming the way customers manage their spending over time.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;TIDAL&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a music platform that empowers artists to thrive as entrepreneurs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Bitkey&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a simple self-custody wallet built for bitcoin.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Proto&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a suite of bitcoin mining products and services. Together, we’re helping build a financial system that is open to everyone.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://block.xyz/en/legal/applicant-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-1yz6bmm:
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies—from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups—use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone’s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Account Executive, SMB Grower team is a highly consultative sales team that is responsible for the growth and retention of Stripe’s largest and fastest growing SMB customers. As an Account Executive, SMB Grower team member, you’ll identify new opportunities for our clients to get the most out of Stripe by quickly understanding our clients’ needs, execute scaled sales strategies to close upsell and renewals with existing Stripe customers, and drive end-to-end campaigns to increase adoption of Stripe’s offerings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own contract renewals and lead negotiations to increase and retain existing customer revenue and Stripe market share&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement full sales cycle strategies for driving product adoption, net new product sales, and client retention at scale among existing Stripe customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solve complex client needs and work across product, sales, risk, and operations teams to improve our product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full sales cycle from lead to close for startups and small/medium businesses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate your own leads through cold calling, blitzing, research, networking, and driving your territory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make every potential Stripe user happy with every interaction, regardless of deal size&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and understand users’ pain points to propose Stripe solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make sure that internal teams are set up for users’ success by coordinating with other Stripe teams&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a well-rounded strategic seller who can build strong relationships with Stripe’s users and manage high velocity deal cycles. If you’re hungry, smart, persistent, and a great teammate, we want to hear from you!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in a client-facing/sales role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to understand complex technical ecosystems and build great relationships with technical users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to drive and close upsell opportunities for additional Stripe products in long-term, consultative engagements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical ability to manage complex pricing and cost considerations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing projects with input from cross-functional teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A knack for working well with a wide range of stakeholders, both internally and externally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability and motivation to operate in a highly ambiguous and fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Superior verbal and written communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in a sales and/or customer-facing role at a high growth technology company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Excel and SQL, or a willingness to learn&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

descriptions.job-1gqv9em:
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies - from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups - use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone&#39;s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Brand Studio sits at the center of everything Stripe shows the world — from visual identity and brand systems to campaigns, events, digital experiences, and global marketing. The studio functions as a creative multiplier: setting the standards, building the systems, and producing the work that helps Stripe show up with intention and quality across every touchpoint.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;World-class creative output requires world-class operational infrastructure. Brand Operations is the function that makes Brand Studio&#39;s work possible at scale — not by managing the execution, but by architecting the conditions that enable it. That means shaping what enters the studio, ensuring clarity before a brief is written, and building the systems that allow creative directors and producers to focus on what they&#39;re here to do: create exceptional work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Most operations leaders are brought in to fix problems. We&#39;re looking for someone who prevents them — and designs the system in which prevention becomes the norm.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Head of Brand Operations exists upstream from creative execution. This role&#39;s job is to ensure the work entering Brand Studio is strategically aligned, clarified, prioritized, resourced, and fully prepared for delivery before it ever reaches a creative director or producer. It also means ensuring the company understands how to work with Brand Studio — what it takes to be a ready partner, and where a given initiative stands on the roadmap. When that infrastructure is working, creative leaders spend their time and energy on the thing they&#39;re actually here to do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role lives at the altitude of setting the team up for success. That means the early-stage, ambiguous conversations where partners are still forming ideas — where the business need hasn&#39;t been articulated, where the biggest risks and opportunities haven&#39;t been named, and where a structural decision will compound over time. It means building and maintaining a roadmap the entire company can see and trust. And it means leading a team of producers who own their projects fully, with your role being the system that makes their ownership meaningful.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role isn&#39;t about staying out of the details entirely — it&#39;s about not defaulting to them. You&#39;ll roll up your sleeves when the moment calls for it. But your primary value is in designing the ecosystem, not running the work. If you want to build the system in which great work consistently becomes possible — and watch it scale — this is a rare opportunity to do that.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Architect the Brand Studio ecosystem. Engage cross-functional partners — Marketing, Product, Comms, PMM — before briefs exist. Turn ambiguous asks into clear, sequenced workstreams so creative leaders inherit clarity, not chaos.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain the Brand Studio roadmap. Sequence and prioritize work based on business importance, creative opportunity, and team capacity. Give leadership a forward-looking view of what&#39;s coming — and the tradeoffs involved.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the conditions for great work. By the time a project reaches a creative director or producer, the business need is defined, stakeholders are aligned, and the problem is framed. Creative leaders shape the work. You shape the environment that makes the work possible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and evolve the operational infrastructure. Build the intake processes, alignment frameworks, and communication rhythms that help Brand Studio run at scale. Refine them as the team grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make how Brand Studio works visible to the company. Partners should be able to find the roadmap, understand where their project stands, and know what it takes to show up ready. The process of working with Brand Studio shouldn&#39;t require a meeting to explain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the business of Brand Studio. Own the budget, manage agency and external production partnerships from procurement through delivery standards, and partner with Finance on clear accounting structures. Give the team the resources and partnerships it needs to deliver.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, develop, and set the cultural tone. Hire great people, build their judgment, and set clear ownership. Give direct feedback, delegate fully, and create the stability that lets people do their best work. You&#39;re a steward of how this team shows up — the norms, the standards, and what it means to operate at this level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay attuned to what&#39;s forming. Brand-level initiatives take shape before briefs exist. Catch early signals across the company and help shape ambiguous ideas into clear outcomes before they reach the studio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Brand Studio at the leadership level. Keep senior leaders informed on priorities, direction, and impact. Make the case for what deserves investment, what should wait, and why.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of experience in brand operations, creative operations, or creative program management. A track record of building operational systems at the function level, not just executing inside them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years managing a team of producers, program managers, or operations professionals, with clear evidence of developing talent and building production capability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience engaging cross-functional partners before briefs are written — shaping workstreams, clarifying business needs, and setting creative teams up to succeed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and owning an annual creative roadmap for a team or function, including prioritization frameworks, capacity planning, and tradeoff communication with senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of building operational infrastructure — intake processes, prioritization systems, partner communication frameworks — that scaled and outlasted your direct involvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing significant budgets, including developing transparent accounting structures in partnership with Finance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management and executive communication skills, with the ability to align competing priorities and influence without authority across a large, cross-functional organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;People management instincts that build team judgment rather than dependency — genuine delegation, direct feedback, and a consistent bias toward developing others over personal execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience incorporating AI into team workflows and driving measurable adoption across a creative or operations team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Experience inside a world-class in-house creative studio or brand team, with deep familiarity with the full creative production lifecycle — from strategy and concept through final delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of building or rebuilding a brand operations function from scratch within a company or team at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing global creative agency and external production partnerships end to end — from procurement and onboarding through creative direction and delivery standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of how brand, marketing, and product teams operate at a technology company, with the instincts to bridge creative ambition and business priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building operational transparency systems — roadmaps, dashboards, or partner-facing communication frameworks — that gave an entire organization real-time visibility into a creative team&#39;s capacity and priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building creative process standards, playbooks, or partnership guidelines that became lasting institutional infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

descriptions.job-0fcdlr2:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;HladdPLXIoNz4nxkqkCuk4rAs8v&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XCikdRR2xoZIjdxtCKcuOflrs8d&quot;&gt;Established in 2018, Bybit is one of the world’s leading cryptocurrency exchanges and digital financial platforms, serving over 80 million users across more than 200 countries and regions. Powered by world-class technology and a user-first mindset, Bybit delivers a seamless ecosystem across trading, payments, wealth management, custody, institutional services, and Web3 — connecting users to the future of digital finance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IF06dI0MPoBwYfxbZ4zui13HsoC&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X5EbdOwvMoYuOmxQBbuueUEDsDd&quot;&gt;Our core values define how we build. We listen, care and improve to create products and experiences that put users first. Backed by a global team of ambitious builders, problem-solvers, and innovators, we foster a high-performance and fast-moving environment where talent is empowered to drive real impact at the global scale. Supported by 24/7 multilingual customer service and a strong commitment to innovation, we are shaping the future of finance through technology, collaboration, and bold execution.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LtVud2dO7oglqJxxZoOucqjJsPc&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RMHkdm4bPo66l3xMVO8ui1o8sle&quot;&gt;Today, Bybit is recognized as one of the most trusted and transparent platforms in the digital asset industry, continuing to expand its global presence while building the infrastructure for the next generation of financial services.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;universal-card-text universal-card-text--bold&quot;&gt;Position Overview&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;universal-card-text&quot;&gt;Responsible for building the underlying risk framework for the exchange&#39;s derivatives product line, covering pricing logic, risk parameter design, and monitoring mechanisms for perpetual contracts, futures contracts, options, and other products, ensuring risk controllability and system stability under extreme market conditions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;universal-card-text&quot;&gt;──────&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;universal-card-text universal-card-text--bold&quot;&gt;Core Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;universal-card-text universal-card-text--bold&quot;&gt;Derivatives Underlying Financial Logic Design&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__ul&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-marker=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__li-content&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;universal-card-text&quot;&gt;Design perpetual contract funding rate mechanisms, including billing frequency, upper/lower bounds, and premium index calculation logic&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__ul&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-marker=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__li-content&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;universal-card-text&quot;&gt;Participate in futures contract settlement price methodology design, including TWAP/index source weighting and anti-manipulation mechanisms&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__ul&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-marker=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__li-content&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;universal-card-text&quot;&gt;Design options product pricing models (Black-Scholes, volatility surface fitting) and assess systemic risk upon introduction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;universal-card-text universal-card-text--bold&quot;&gt;Risk Parameter Design &amp;amp; Iteration&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__ul&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-marker=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__li-content&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;universal-card-text&quot;&gt;Develop maximum leverage, position limit strategies per instrument, dynamically adjusted based on market depth&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__ul&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-marker=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__li-content&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;universal-card-text&quot;&gt;Design ADL (Auto-Deleveraging) trigger mechanisms and ranking rules, optimizing user experience and risk isolation effectiveness&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;universal-card-text universal-card-text--bold&quot;&gt;Risk Monitoring &amp;amp; Alerts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__ul&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-marker=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__li-content&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;universal-card-text&quot;&gt;Design insurance fund utilization rules and replenishment mechanisms&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__ul&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-marker=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__li-content&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;universal-card-text&quot;&gt;Develop circuit breaker contingency plans and emergency response procedures for extreme market events (flash crashes, liquidity crises)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__ul&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-marker=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__li-content&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;universal-card-text&quot;&gt;Monitor abnormal Mark Price deviations from spot index to prevent unreasonable liquidations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;universal-card-text universal-card-text--bold&quot;&gt;Cross-Department Collaboration&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__ul&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-marker=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__li-content&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;universal-card-text&quot;&gt;Collaborate with product teams to define risk control admission criteria for new derivative listings (token liquidity, market cap, volatility thresholds)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__ul&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-marker=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__li-content&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;universal-card-text&quot;&gt;Participate in Market Surveillance to investigate suspected manipulation of liquidations, wash trading, pump-and-dump, and other market violations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;universal-card-text&quot;&gt;──────&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;universal-card-text universal-card-text--bold&quot;&gt;Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;universal-card-text universal-card-text--bold&quot;&gt;Required&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__ul&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-marker=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__li-content&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;universal-card-text&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or above in Finance, Mathematics, Statistics, Computer Science, or related fields&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__ul&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-marker=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__li-content&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;universal-card-text&quot;&gt;3+ years of derivatives-related experience, including traditional finance (futures/options market making, risk management) or crypto exchange risk management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__ul&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-marker=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__li-content&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;universal-card-text&quot;&gt;Deep understanding of perpetual contract mechanics (funding rate, Mark Price, liquidation logic) and differences from traditional futures&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__ul&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-marker=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__li-content&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;universal-card-text&quot;&gt;Proficient in Python, capable of independently conducting data analysis, parameter backtesting, and model validation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__ul&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-marker=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__li-content&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;universal-card-text&quot;&gt;Solid foundation in probability theory and statistics, understanding of VaR, Expected Shortfall, and other risk measurement methodologies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;universal-card-text universal-card-text--bold&quot;&gt;Preferred&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__ul&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-marker=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__li-content&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;universal-card-text&quot;&gt;Familiarity with options pricing theory, with experience in volatility smile/surface modeling&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__ul&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-marker=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__li-content&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;universal-card-text&quot;&gt;Proficiency in SQL / Spark, able to independently query on-chain or exchange internal data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Bybit, we are committed to fostering a supportive and enriching work environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Our benefits include:&lt;br&gt;- Study Growth Fund: We support your professional development and continuous learning.&lt;br&gt;- Internal Events: Participate in regular team-building activities, workshops, and events designed to promote collaboration and innovation.&lt;br&gt;- Global Collaboration: Be part of a diverse, international team, working alongside colleagues from around the world.&lt;br&gt;- Career Advancement: Access opportunities for growth and advancement within a rapidly expanding global company.&lt;br&gt;- Internal Mobility: Grow with us- Your long-term development is important to us. We offer internal job opportunities to help build your career path.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-0fnb0bi:
&lt;p&gt;At Shakepay, we’re on a mission to usher in the bitcoin golden age. We’re reimagining financial services to give every Canadian their fair shake.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our culture is built around doing work that matters, winning as a team, and celebrating success. If you&#39;re the kind of person who values growth, shipping fast, and sharing your ideas openly with a group of like-minded people, come and build with us!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Shakepay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Since 2015, we&#39;ve been on a mission to help Canadians build long-term wealth through bitcoin. Over the past few years, we&#39;ve expanded beyond buying and selling bitcoin to offer a growing suite of everyday financial products - including the Shakepay Card, direct deposit, bill payments and Interac e-Transfer - making it easier to earn, save and use bitcoin every day. Today, more than 1.5 million Canadians use Shakepay to grow their bitcoin savings and take control of their financial future as we continue to push the boundaries of what modern financial services can look like.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re regulated as an investment dealer across all Canadian provinces and territories, and backed by renowned venture capitalists with a funding of $44M. We have a passionate, loyal, and growing community, and we’re looking for people who want to help us build something truly special.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Platform Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Platform team empowers other engineering teams at Shakepay by providing the tools, infrastructure, and best practices they need to be autonomous, productive, and reliable. As the Platform Engineering Manager, you’ll ensure we balance fast delivery with operational excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Senior Engineering Manager to lead and grow a team of platform engineers with a focus on Infrastructure, SRE and DevOps .&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is responsible for people leadership, technical direction, and delivery across platform initiatives that impact every engineering team at Shakepay. You’ll partner closely with Engineers, Engineering leaders, Security, and Compliance, and lead by example, staying hands-on where it matters to shape technical decisions, support delivery, and ensure our platform evolves in step with both developer and business needs.&amp;nbsp;You’ll also play a key role in developing an agentic layer of the platform, building intelligent tooling and agentic workflows that automate repetitive work, assist engineers in complex tasks, and enable teams across the company to interact with systems and data in new ways&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You don’t need to be the deepest expert in every area, but you must be technically strong enough to set direction, challenge assumptions, and make tradeoffs across DevEx, infrastructure, and reliability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach, and grow a team of platform engineers across Infrastructure, DevOps and Developer Experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set technical direction for platform architecture and ensure roadmap execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance short-term delivery with long-term investments in tooling, infrastructure, and reliability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee cloud infrastructure, deployment pipelines, and operational tooling in a regulated environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and build AI-powered internal tools and agentic workflows that automate tasks and augment engineering productivity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve developer productivity by reducing friction in onboarding, CI/CD, and local-to-prod workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure systems are secure, scalable, observable, and resilient as Shakepay grows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own incident management practices, postmortems, and sustainability of the on-call rotation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with product engineering, security, and compliance stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advocate for platform work by tying technical initiatives to business and customer impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in platform, infrastructure, DevOps or SRE roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years managing and growing high-performing teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with technologies like Kubernetes, AWS, Terraform, ArgoCD, Datadog, PostgreSQL, CI/CD tooling, and GitOps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating production systems and supporting on-call rotations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to set technical direction across both developer experience and infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaboration and communication skills, with a focus on business impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort using AI tools in your day-to-day workflow to accelerate development, debugging, and learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in fintech or other regulated environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience as a Staff or Senior Engineer before moving into management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in Bitcoin and excitement to learn more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help shape the future of money: &lt;/strong&gt;Be part of a team that&#39;s revolutionizing financial services in Canada, one sat at a time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact millions: &lt;/strong&gt;As cryptocurrency continues to gain traction, our potential for growth is massive. You can help us bring Shakepay and Bitcoin to all Canadians.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow your career: &lt;/strong&gt;We’re growing, and so can you! We have programs in place to encourage continuous learning, growth, and development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ideas, not titles: &lt;/strong&gt;We want the best ideas to make their way through, no matter where they come from.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perks and benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🤖 Generous AI token budget (currently unlimited)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🤝 Stock options as part of their total compensation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🦷 Full health and dental benefits, including a separate budget to take care of your mental health&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌎 Remote-friendly: Work from anywhere in Canada, with optional access to our office spaces in Montreal and Toronto.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🆙 A $2,000 annual budget for courses, certifications, and training to support your career growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌴&amp;nbsp; 20 days of vacation per year. And if you use all your vacation, we give you a $1,000 bonus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🐣 Parental leave top up to 100% of your salary for 18 weeks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🙌 Quarterly team-specific or company-wide offsite to connect with each other&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;T&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;he base salary range for this position is $230,000 - 280,000 CAD. Base pay may vary based on factors such as years of experience, skills and qualifications. Additionally, employees are eligible for equity,&amp;nbsp; pay increases based on performance, benefits including health and dental care, and paid time off. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We understand that potential can be just as valuable as experience. If you&#39;re eager to learn, grow, and contribute to the mission but worry that you may not have the “right” experience, we still want you to apply.&amp;nbsp;We encourage applications from everyone, regardless of background and life experience. We’re firm believers that &lt;a href=&quot;https://gist.github.com/gtallen1187/e83ed02eac6cc8d7e185&quot;&gt;a little bit of slope makes up for a lot of y-intercept&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fluency in English is required due to the percentage of English-speaking customers and the nature of our platform, which is available to all Canadians.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We use technology, including artificial intelligence (AI), to support certain parts of our hiring process. This can include tools that assist with scheduling, application review, candidate communications, and generating interview notes, guides, or summaries so our team can stay focused on the conversation. All hiring decisions are made by our hiring team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

descriptions.job-07wj9um:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Galaxy Digital Inc. (Nasdaq: GLXY) is a global leader in digital assets and data center infrastructure, growing the economy that runs on code. Galaxy delivers the onchain infrastructure that connects institutions to digital assets, including trading, advisory, asset management, staking, self-custody, and tokenization. Galaxy also develops and operates data center infrastructure to power AI and HPC workloads. Anchored by its Helios campus in Texas, Galaxy is building a multi-gigawatt pipeline of more than 5.7 GW of potential capacity, positioning it among the largest and fastest-growing data center developers in North America.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Company is headquartered in New York City, with offices across North America, Europe, the Middle East, and Asia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Additional information about Galaxy&#39;s businesses and products is available on &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.galaxy.com/&quot;&gt;www.galaxy.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Value:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a diverse team of free thinkers, and fast movers united to help investors and creators energize the global economy. We are looking for individuals&amp;nbsp;who&amp;nbsp;thrive in a culture of builders and overachievers&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;embrace high performance, transparent feedback, and a mission-first approach. Our culture shapes our way of working and gets us where we want to be.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Seek Excellence.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Be Selective To Be Effective.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Be Highly Aligned, Loosely Coupled.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Disagree Transparently.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Encourage Independent Decision-Making.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Build Dream Teams.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the EHS Engineer, you will serve as a technical safety professional at our Helios data center campus in Afton, Texas, reporting to the Sr. Manager, EHS and working alongside operations and construction teams. You will be responsible for independently managing assigned EHS compliance programs, conducting incident investigations, and delivering EHS training programs. This role requires a technically capable field professional who can identify hazards, implement controls, and maintain a strong preventive safety culture on site.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a technical EHS resource for assigned work areas at our Helios data center campus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, implement, and maintain site-level EHS programs in compliance with applicable regulatory standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct and document job hazard analyses (JHAs), pre-task planning, and risk assessments across assigned Galaxy work areas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage hazardous waste programs, including characterization, labeling, manifesting, and regulatory reporting (RCRA, satellite accumulation) for operations assignments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead site-level incident and near-miss investigations; develop corrective action plans and track to closure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write incident investigation reports and corrective action plans; communicate hazard findings to operations and construction teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and deliver EHS training programs for Galaxy employees, subcontractors, and new hires independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain OSHA recordkeeping obligations, including 300/300A logs, 301 forms, and applicable regulatory submittals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct workplace risk/exposure assessments for various classes of hazards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Periodically inspect and audit safe work practices to ensure compliance with regulations and company policies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical guidance to EHS Technicians&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Escalate regulatory concerns and significant safety issues to the Sr. Manager, EHS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other duties as assigned by the Sr. Manager, EHS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in EHS, Safety, Environmental Science, or Engineering required; equivalent practical experience may be substituted for formal education&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3–5 years of EHS experience in critical facility / industrial operations environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ASP preferred; working toward CSP encouraged&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Site-level compliance program and hands-on incident investigation experience required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of OSHA, EPA, &amp;amp; NFPA standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in EHS recordkeeping, OSHA 300 log management, and training documentation systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective communicator across field teams, contractors, and leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in data centers, critical facilities, or large-scale commercial construction projects preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The base salary ranges included below will be commensurate with the candidate&#39;s experience, expertise, and local market. Final offer amounts are determined by multiple factors, including candidate experience and expertise. At Galaxy, we maintain a total compensation philosophy that consists of a competitive base salary, annual bonus, and equity incentives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer (Helios):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive base salary and discretionary bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid Time Off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company-paid Holidays (14)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company-paid health and protective benefits for employees, partners, and other dependents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3% 401(k) company contribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous paid Parental Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free coaching and counseling sessions through Headspace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free breakfast and lunch daily &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Smart, entrepreneurial, and fun colleagues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Resource Groups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job__pay-ranges&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;body&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*Benefits may vary depending on location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Apply now and join us as we grow the economy that runs on code.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The base salary ranges included below will be commensurate with candidate experience, expertise and local market. Final offer amounts are determined by multiple factors, including candidate experience and expertise. At Galaxy, we maintain a total compensation philosophy which consists of a competitive base salary, annual bonus, and equity incentives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Galaxy respects diversity and seeks to provide equal employment opportunities to all employees and job applicants for employment without regard to actual or perceived age, race, color, creed, religion, sex or gender (including pregnancy, childbirth, lactation and related medical conditions), gender identity or gender expression (including transgender status), sexual orientation, marital or partnership or caregiver status, ancestry, national origin, citizenship status, disability, military or veteran status, protected medical condition as defined by applicable state or local law, genetic information or predisposing genetic characteristic, or other characteristic protected by applicable federal, state, or local laws and ordinances.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We will endeavor to make a reasonable accommodation to the known limitations of a qualified applicant with a disability unless the accommodation would impose an undue hardship on the operation of our business. If you believe you require such assistance to complete the application process or to participate in an interview, please contact &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:careers@galaxy.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;careers@galaxy.com.&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-1qia8ny:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Gemini is a global crypto and Web3 platform founded by Cameron and Tyler Winklevoss in 2014, offering a wide range of simple, reliable, and secure crypto products and services to individuals and institutions in over 70 countries. Our mission is to unlock the next era of financial, creative, and personal freedom by providing trusted access to the decentralized future. We envision a world where crypto reshapes the global financial system, internet, and money to create greater choice, independence, and opportunity for all — bridging traditional finance with the emerging cryptoeconomy in a way that is more open, fair, and secure. As a publicly traded company, Gemini is poised to accelerate this vision with greater scale, reach, and impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Department: Platform&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Platform organization’s purpose is to enable Gemini to scale effectively and empower our engineering teams to focus on building innovative financial products and experiences for individuals around the world. Platform focuses around building a scalable and secure foundations platform, enabling Engineering to deploy, validate, and operate their services in production, improve resiliency of the service and increase organizational efficiency by reducing operational toil and increase system efficiency through architectural evolution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Platform team engages directly with our other engineering teams to onboard them onto our platform systems, reviewing and recommending design and architectural decisions, and guiding our engineering teams on how to implement the tooling provided by the larger Platform organization required to ensure systems can scale and react to changing conditions, with continuous improvement loops.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role: Senior Data Platform Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Data Platform Engineer, you&#39;ll be an SRE for our data infrastructure: responsible for the reliability, automation, and operability of the database and datastore fleet, not just tuning any single engine. You&#39;ll work closely with data engineering and product engineering teams to build self-service, automated foundations that let teams provision, scale, and operate their own datastores safely.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your role centers on deep relational database expertise (PostgreSQL, Aurora) - internals, replication, failover, backup/recovery, and query performance - paired with the automation and tooling to run that expertise at scale rather than by hand. You&#39;ll extend that same automation-first discipline to the other datastores in our fleet - NoSQL/document, columnar, key-value, and streaming systems - so that scaling, failover, and provisioning are repeatable and largely self-service. You&#39;ll drive improvements to observability, incident response, and uptime posture through proactive ownership of the platform, and you&#39;ll bring SRE practices (SLOs, error budgets, toil reduction, blameless postmortems) to how we run data infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for someone who thinks in systems and automation first, thrives on cross-team collaboration, and wants to reduce operational toil across a diverse set of database technologies in a fast-paced, cloud-native environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automation and Reliability Engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; Build Infrastructure as Code (IaC), CLI tools, and CI/CD-driven automation that make database provisioning, scaling, failover, and deployment self-service, consistent, and repeatable across environments - this is the core of the role, not a supporting activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Database Scaling and Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as the team&#39;s depth on relational database systems (e.g., Amazon Aurora, PostgreSQL) - replication topologies, failover, backup/recovery, and query/engine-level performance - ensuring high performance and availability under growing workloads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fleet-Wide Infrastructure Design:&lt;/strong&gt; Extend that operational rigor to the rest of the datastore fleet - document, key-value, and columnar systems - applying the right paradigm to the right workload and building common tooling and guardrails across all of them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High Availability, Observability, and SRE Practice:&lt;/strong&gt; Define and track SLOs/error budgets, build proactive monitoring and alerting, implement high-availability architectures, and participate in the on-call rotation to troubleshoot and resolve production issues quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pipeline Integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with data and product engineering teams to integrate with upstream and downstream pipelines - both real-time and batch - via message queues (e.g., Kafka), ETL workflows, and processing frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Tuning and Troubleshooting:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify and resolve performance bottlenecks at both the query and infrastructure levels across engines. Establish alerting, observability, and incident response procedures that reduce MTTR and maintain service health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Toil Reduction and Operational Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Continuously identify and automate away repetitive operational work; contribute to shared documentation, incident retrospectives, and platform playbooks to improve team effectiveness and reliability of operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5 years of experience in the field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep, specialist-level experience managing and scaling relational databases - cloud-native systems like PostgreSQL, Amazon Aurora, or similar - including replication, failover, backup/recovery, and query/engine performance tuning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated SRE mindset: experience building automation, self-service tooling, and guardrails that eliminate manual, repetitive database operations rather than performing them by hand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with at least one non-relational paradigm in production (e.g., NoSQL, columnar, document, key-value), and working knowledge of when to apply each.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with cloud-based data platforms and services such as AWS RDS, Redshift, EMR, Google BigQuery, or Databricks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in an infrastructure as code environment (Terraform), developing automated solutions to solve support and operational issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency writing scripts, CLIs, or services that increase developer productivity and reduce operational toil, in languages like Python, Go, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of CI/CD, observability tooling, SLOs/error budgets, and incident response in production environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating with data pipelines and real-time messaging systems like Kafka or Kinesis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable participating in on-call rotations and owning uptime and recovery responsibilities across multiple database technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and collaboration skills; able to work effectively across infrastructure, data, and product teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;It Pays to Work Here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;The compensation &amp;amp; benefits package for this role includes:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Competitive starting pay&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;A discretionary annual bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Long-term incentive in the form of a new hire equity grant&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Comprehensive health plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;401K with company matching&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Paid Parental Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Flexible time off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary Range&lt;/strong&gt;: The base salary range for this role is between $126,000 - $180,000 in the State of New York. This range is not inclusive of our discretionary bonus or equity package. When determining a candidate’s compensation, we consider a number of factors including skillset, experience, job scope, and current market data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;In the United States, we offer a hybrid work approach at our hub offices, balancing the benefits of in-person collaboration with the flexibility of remote work. Expectations may vary by location and role, so candidates are encouraged to connect with their recruiter to learn more about the specific policy for the role. Employees who do not live near one of our hubs are part of our remote workforce. All employees, however, are required to onboard in-person at one of our office locations.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Gemini, we strive to build diverse teams that reflect the people we want to empower through our products, and we are committed to equal employment opportunity regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity, or Veteran status. Equal Opportunity is the Law, and Gemini is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace. If you have a specific need that requires accommodation, please let a member of the People Team know.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;#LI-AA1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

descriptions.job-0j5sihq:
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;BDR/SDR – Brave Search API&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SF hybrid or Remote - USA preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About Brave&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Brave is on a mission to protect the human right to privacy online. We’ve built a free web browser that blocks creepy ads and trackers by default, a private search engine with a &lt;em&gt;truly&lt;/em&gt; independent index, a private ad network (opt-in!) that directly rewards you for your attention, and a browser-native AI integration focused on keeping private data private. And we’re just getting started. Already 120 million people have switched to Brave for a faster, more private web. Millions more switch every month.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The internet is a sea of ads, hackers, and echo chambers. Big Tech makes huge profits off our data, and tells us what’s true and what’s not. Brave is fighting back. Join us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Role&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a driven BDR/SDR&amp;nbsp; to help us expand our footprint in the developer and enterprise markets and create our internal lead generation process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a BDR for the Brave Search API, you will be the first point of contact for potential enterprise and developer users. Your primary goal is to identify, qualify, and schedule meetings for our Account Executives, focusing on organizations looking to integrate privacy-centric search capabilities into their products. You will play a critical role in driving revenue growth by connecting our technology with businesses that value user privacy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prospecting: Identify and research potential clients (SaaS companies, media outlets, developer tools) that would benefit from integrating the Brave Search API.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outreach: Execute multi-channel outreach campaigns (email, LinkedIn, cold calling) to engage CTOs, Product Managers, and Lead Developers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualification: Conduct discovery calls to understand technical requirements, pain points regarding current search providers, and budget authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pipeline Management: Maintain accurate records of all activities and leads in our CRM (e.g., Salesforce/HubSpot).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaboration: Work closely with the Marketing and Product teams to refine messaging and stay updated on new API features and use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Market Intelligence: Gather feedback from prospects to help shape the product roadmap and sales strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Qualifications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience: 1–3 years of experience in BDR/SDR roles, preferably in B2B SaaS, API/Developer Tools, or Privacy Tech.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication: Exceptional written and verbal communication skills; ability to explain technical concepts to non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tech Savviness: Familiarity with APIs, developer ecosystems, or the ability to quickly learn technical product details.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mindset: A strong belief in the mission of online privacy and user data sovereignty.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tools: Proficiency with CRM software, LinkedIn Sales Navigator, and outreach automation tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Compensation - $65K-70K base salary plus commission and benefits&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Why Join Brave?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Industry-leader in privacy, with a research and engineering team that’s innovating everyday to keep people safer online and beat Big Tech&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly competitive salaries &amp;amp; benefits, and generous home-office stipends&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fully remote team (no office, no commute)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimal meetings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Welcoming, humble, ridiculously smart teammates, and a truly flat org structure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to get in early at a hyper-growth company, and revolutionize the web&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oh, and did we mention Brendan, our CEO &amp;amp; co-founder, &lt;em&gt;invented&lt;/em&gt; JavaScript?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Check us out&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/brave-software/mycompany/&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; |&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.glassdoor.com/Overview/Working-at-Brave-EI_IE2159279.11,16.htm&quot;&gt; Glassdoor&lt;/a&gt; |&lt;a href=&quot;https://brave.com/&quot;&gt; brave.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

descriptions.job-0jw4mse:
&lt;h3&gt;About the Position&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re seeking an IT Operations Engineer to support, configure and maintain multiple systems across all of our technology stacks, including desktop environments, network infrastructure and various application platforms. Working closely with specialised teams across the firm, you will help build and maintain the infrastructure that powers our trading operations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Technology is central to our business, and you’ll play a crucial role in responding to tech support requests, building and configuring Windows, Linux and macOS laptops, desktops and servers, supporting our Windows domain infrastructure, monitoring critical systems and helping with projects to optimise the way we work. You’ll also design, build and maintain automations with code to streamline recurring IT support tasks, reduce manual toil and improve team scalability.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your success will depend on exceptional problem-solving abilities and interpersonal skills as you collaborate with our technically-sophisticated users. The role demands real-time troubleshooting expertise, patient listening, comfort with asking clarifying questions and the humility to acknowledge mistakes. You&#39;ll experience immediate feedback and the satisfaction of seeing your solutions directly impact our business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits within our global IT Operations group, a team of systems and end user support engineers responsible for monitoring and managing our mixed Windows, Linux and macOS environment across a worldwide physical and virtual computing landscape.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About You&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about helping end users and solving technical problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have strong experience administering Windows desktop and server environments in production, including Active Directory, Group Policy and related tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced with troubleshooting MDM for iOS, macOS and Android devices on platforms such as Omnissa Workspace ONE or Jamf&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced with—or interested in—supporting and optimising platforms and tools, such as Chocolatey, Google Workspace and Bloomberg&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong written and verbal communicator, spanning technical documentation and day-to-day support of end users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Having strong technical skills in scripting for Windows (especially in PowerShell) or any Linux scripting experience (in Bash or Python) is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you&#39;re a recruiting agency and want to partner with us, please reach out to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:agency-partnerships@janestreet.com&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;agency-partnerships@janestreet.com&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

descriptions.job-163hq72:
&lt;p&gt;Since we opened our doors in 2009, the world of commerce has evolved immensely, and so has Square. After enabling anyone to take payments and never miss a sale, we saw sellers stymied by disparate, outmoded products and tools that wouldn’t work together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;So we expanded into software and started building integrated, omnichannel solutions – to help sellers sell online, manage inventory, offer buy now, pay later functionality, book appointments, engage loyal buyers, and hire and pay staff. Across it all, we’ve embedded financial services tools at the point of sale, so merchants can access a business loan and manage their cash flow in one place. Afterpay furthers our goal to provide omnichannel tools that unlock meaningful value and growth, enabling sellers to capture the next generation shopper, increase order sizes, and compete at a larger scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today, we are a partner to sellers of all sizes – large, enterprise-scale businesses with complex operations, sellers just starting, as well as merchants who began selling with Square and have grown larger over time. As our sellers grow, so do our solutions. There is a massive opportunity in front of us. We’re building a significant, meaningful, and lasting business, and we are helping sellers worldwide do the same.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Launched in October 2025, Neighborhoods is a new network between Cash App and Square that gives local businesses the ability to offer online ordering with the power of a mobile app. Sellers get their own branded storefront, accessible on both web and inside Cash App. Customers can seamlessly order ahead, reorder, earn rewards and stay connected to support the businesses they love. With 4 million sellers using Square and 57 million monthly active accounts on Cash App, we have a unique opportunity to connect local sellers and local customers in their area. Learn more about Neighborhoods in the &lt;a href=&quot;https://squareup.com/us/en/press/neighborhoods-by-cash-app&quot;&gt;2025 Fall Square Release&lt;/a&gt; announcement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a senior iOS engineer on the Neighborhoods team, you will help bring the vision of the neighborhood network to life. You will shape the technical direction for Neighborhoods mobile experiences across Cash App and Square Point of Sale, while staying hands-on with the systems and features that help customers discover and support local businesses. You will lead cross-team technical decisions, work across organizational boundaries with teams in Square and Cash App, and help other engineers deliver reliable, high-quality product experiences.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a small, collaborative and remote-friendly team. We believe in people over process, value authenticity and openness, and have a bias for action. Come join us!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead major Neighborhoods mobile workstreams across Cash App and Square&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead major mobile workstreams within a company-level initiative to redefine local commerce and connect the Square and Cash App ecosystems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive cross-team architecture and execution with teams across Square and Cash App to deliver seamless integration of Neighborhoods loyalty, marketing, and ordering features in Cash App running on Square’s platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the mobile systems that connect customer discovery in Cash App with seller ordering and fulfillment workflows in Square Point of Sale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay hands-on in iOS development using SwiftUI, Workflow, and related technologies across the Square Point of Sale and Cash App codebases, making tradeoffs that keep mobile experiences reliable, scalable, and polished&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with backend, web, and Android engineers to ship features with a focus on quality and craft, while mentoring engineers and raising the technical bar for the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally with product managers and designers to define product scope, sequence ambiguous work, and make clear technical and product tradeoffs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead as an AI-native product engineer&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI tools as a native part of feature development: exploring unfamiliar codebases, prototyping product ideas, accelerating implementation, generating tests, improving observability, and tightening documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, teach, and scale practical AI-assisted workflows for product engineering, especially in cross-codebase feature work, migration, debugging, QA, experimentation, and rapid iteration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply strong judgment around AI-generated work: verify behavior, protect customer trust, preserve maintainability, and use AI to raise the team’s technical bar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Model how a senior engineer uses AI to multiply impact without losing product taste, architectural ownership, or accountability for the systems we ship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of relevant experience with iOS engineering design and implementation, including deep Swift and Objective-C experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading iOS architecture with unidirectional data flow, declarative UI frameworks, and scalable mobile patterns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading medium-to-large, multi-person mobile initiatives that cross team boundaries, from ambiguous problem framing through delivery, including applying AI tools thoughtfully to improve engineering speed, quality, and learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to work across team boundaries and disciplines to deliver remarkable solutions to customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record shaping team mission and roadmap, rallying others around technical direction, and mentoring engineers to expand their scope and impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technologies We Use and Teach&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SwiftUI, UIKit, Swift Concurrency, Combine&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Protocol Buffers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bazel for our build environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI tools including Cursor, Claude Code, Goose&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Block takes a market-based approach to pay, and pay may vary depending on your location. U.S. locations are categorized into one of four zones based on a cost of labor index for that geographic area. The successful candidate’s starting pay will be determined based on job-related skills, experience, qualifications, work location, and market conditions. These ranges may be modified in the future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To find a location’s zone designation, please refer to this&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://block.xyz/documents/salaryzones.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;resource&lt;/a&gt;. If a location of interest is not listed, please speak with a recruiter for additional information.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Zone A:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$217,800&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$326,800 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Zone B: &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$207,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$310,400 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Zone C:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$196,100&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$294,100 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Zone D:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$185,200&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$277,800 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Guidelines&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates may submit up to 9 active applications within a 60-day period. Reapplications to the same role are accepted 90 days after a previous application has been reviewed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of AI in Our Hiring Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We may use automated AI tools to evaluate job applications for efficiency and consistency. These tools comply with local regulations, including bias audits, and we handle all personal data in accordance with state and local privacy laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contact us &lt;a href=&quot;https://privacy.block.xyz/privacyportal/form&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;with hiring practice or data usage questions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Every benefit we offer is designed with one goal: empowering you to do the best work of your career while building the life you want. Remote work, medical insurance, flexible time off, retirement savings plans, and modern family planning are just some of our offering.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://block.xyz/employee-benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://block.xyz/documents/benefits.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Check out our other benefits at Block.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Block, Inc. (NYSE: XYZ) builds technology to increase access to the global economy. Each of our brands unlocks different aspects of the economy for more people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Square&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;makes commerce and financial services accessible to sellers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Cash App&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is the easy way to spend, send, and store money.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Afterpay&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is transforming the way customers manage their spending over time.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;TIDAL&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a music platform that empowers artists to thrive as entrepreneurs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Bitkey&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a simple self-custody wallet built for bitcoin.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Proto&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a suite of bitcoin mining products and services. Together, we’re helping build a financial system that is open to everyone.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://block.xyz/en/legal/applicant-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-1doqfku:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Galaxy Digital Inc. (Nasdaq: GLXY) is a global leader in digital assets and data center infrastructure, growing the economy that runs on code. Galaxy delivers the onchain infrastructure that connects institutions to digital assets, including trading, advisory, asset management, staking, self-custody, and tokenization. Galaxy also develops and operates data center infrastructure to power AI and HPC workloads. Anchored by its Helios campus in Texas, Galaxy is building a multi-gigawatt pipeline of more than 5.7 GW of potential capacity, positioning it among the largest and fastest-growing data center developers in North America.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Company is headquartered in New York City, with offices across North America, Europe, the Middle East, and Asia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Additional information about Galaxy&#39;s businesses and products is available on &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.galaxy.com/&quot;&gt;www.galaxy.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Value:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a diverse team of free thinkers, and fast movers united to help investors and creators energize the global economy. We are looking for individuals&amp;nbsp;who&amp;nbsp;thrive in a culture of builders and overachievers&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;embrace high performance, transparent feedback, and a mission-first approach. Our culture shapes our way of working and gets us where we want to be.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Seek Excellence.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Be Selective To Be Effective.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Be Highly Aligned, Loosely Coupled.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Disagree Transparently.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Encourage Independent Decision-Making.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Build Dream Teams.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;You are a detail-oriented, intellectually curious finance professional who is excited to build a career in Investor Relations. As an Analyst on the Investor Relations team, you&#39;ll support the planning, development, and execution of a variety of investor relations initiatives. Reporting to the Head of Investor Relations, you&#39;ll help prepare investor communications, analyze market and shareholder data, and contribute to projects that support Galaxy’s engagement with investors, analysts, and other key stakeholders. This role offers broad exposure to senior leadership and the opportunity to develop a strong understanding of capital markets, financial communications, and the digital asset industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Support the execution of Galaxy&#39;s investor relations program and strategic initiatives alongside the Head of Investor Relations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Assist in preparing quarterly earnings materials, including investor presentations, conference call scripts, FAQs, earnings releases, and supporting analyses.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Monitor and summarize sell-side research, consensus estimates, peer performance, industry developments, and market trends affecting Galaxy and the broader digital asset ecosystem.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Help maintain shareholder and investor databases, analyze ownership trends, and support investor targeting initiatives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Coordinate investor meetings, conferences, non-deal roadshows, and the Investor Relations calendar, including scheduling and tracking engagement activity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Assist in developing presentation materials, talking points, and briefing documents for investor, client, and executive meetings.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Partner with Finance, Communications, Legal, Corporate Development, and other cross-functional teams to support consistent external messaging and disclosures.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Conduct financial, competitive, and market research to support strategic projects and management requests.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Contribute to process improvements and help build scalable reporting and tracking tools for the Investor Relations function.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years of experience in Investor Relations, Investment Banking, Equity Research, Corporate Finance, Consulting, or a similar analytical role (internship experience will also be considered).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Finance, Accounting, Economics, Business, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills with the ability to interpret financial data and market information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic understanding of financial statements, valuation concepts, and capital markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Excel and PowerPoint; experience building financial models is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Excellent written and verbal communication skills with strong attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized with the ability to manage multiple priorities in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong work ethic, curiosity, and willingness to learn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to handle confidential information with professionalism and discretion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative mindset with the ability to work effectively across teams.&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Internship or full-time experience in investment banking, equity research, corporate finance, investor relations, or asset management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Interest in digital assets, fintech, or financial markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Experience with financial modeling and valuation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with Bloomberg, FactSet, or similar financial data platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Experience working in a high-growth technology or financial services environment.&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun Highlight SCXW81796384 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW81796384 BCX0&quot;&gt;Competitive base salary and discretionary bonus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW74345553 BCX0&quot;&gt;Hybrid/Flexible Working Arrangements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW74345553 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Time Off (paid)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3% 401(k) company contribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company-paid health and protective benefits for employees, partners, and other dependents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous paid Parental Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW86126979 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW86126979 BCX0&quot;&gt;Competitive family planning benefits for US employees&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW86126979 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities to learn about the Crypto industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Smart, entrepreneurial, and fun colleagues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun Highlight SCXW75787114 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW75787114 BCX0&quot;&gt;Free daily snacks and weekly breakfasts/lunches&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW75787114 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Resource Groups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free coaching and counseling sessions through Headspace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Apply now and join us as we grow the economy that runs on code.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The base salary ranges included below will be commensurate with candidate experience, expertise and local market. Final offer amounts are determined by multiple factors, including candidate experience and expertise. At Galaxy, we maintain a total compensation philosophy which consists of a competitive base salary, annual bonus, and equity incentives.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$100,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$120,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Galaxy respects diversity and seeks to provide equal employment opportunities to all employees and job applicants for employment without regard to actual or perceived age, race, color, creed, religion, sex or gender (including pregnancy, childbirth, lactation and related medical conditions), gender identity or gender expression (including transgender status), sexual orientation, marital or partnership or caregiver status, ancestry, national origin, citizenship status, disability, military or veteran status, protected medical condition as defined by applicable state or local law, genetic information or predisposing genetic characteristic, or other characteristic protected by applicable federal, state, or local laws and ordinances.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We will endeavor to make a reasonable accommodation to the known limitations of a qualified applicant with a disability unless the accommodation would impose an undue hardship on the operation of our business. If you believe you require such assistance to complete the application process or to participate in an interview, please contact &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:careers@galaxy.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;careers@galaxy.com.&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-1b60llq:
&lt;h2&gt;Who we are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About Stripe&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies—from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups—use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone’s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the team&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Stripe, our Mexico City office is a vibrant hub at the forefront of our mission to reshape the financial landscape for businesses worldwide. Our team prioritizes collaboration, innovation, and excellence. As a member of the Mexico City team, you&#39;ll be part of a mission-driven community dedicated to enhancing the global economy and increasing the GDP of the internet. We strive for excellence by creating with craft and beauty, while having fun and celebrating our successes together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;We cultivate a culture of collaboration, inclusivity, and support where every team member’s voice matters. Our commitment shines through as we handle over a million support cases each year, empowering our users not just to solve problems but to achieve their goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Troubleshoot and solve external user issues&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Analyze our processes and instigate changes to help scale our operations and improve user experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Work closely with other Stripe teams to improve our product offerings and messaging around new products and features&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Gain unique insights into how thousands of businesses on Stripe scale and operate&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Have an opportunity to learn how Stripe operates from the ground up and make a real impact on the future of the organization&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Be a part of building a brand-new team and operational culture for Stripe&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Partner with global operations specialists or business process owners to run a critical workflow&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Who you are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You have a user-first mindset and are energized by the challenge of solving difficult problems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You have excellent communication skills, both written and verbal&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You excel in critical thinking and problem solving&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You have prior experience in customer service or internal and external user-facing operations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You enjoy learning about technical products and processes, you&#39;re an organized, self-starter with passion for finding solutions to our user’s challenges&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You have a process-oriented mindset and the ability to get things done&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You enjoy working in an in-office environment with strong cross-team collaboration and support&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You prioritize well and enjoy working in a quick-moving environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You are humble and have a proven track record for working well across teams and with external partners&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You&#39;re willing to periodically work a weekend day for which you&#39;ll receive a weekday off. The SDC operates during daytime hours with shifts from the morning through early evening&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Prior experience or knowledge in user support&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Prior experience working on projects or process improvement initiatives&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

descriptions.job-0xoqq1q:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Ripple, we’re building a world where value moves like information does today. It’s big, it’s bold, and we’re already doing it. Through our crypto solutions for financial institutions, businesses, governments and developers, we are improving the global financial system and creating greater economic fairness and opportunity for more people, in more places around the world. And we get to do the best work of our career and grow our skills surrounded by colleagues who have our backs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If you’re ready to see your impact and unlock incredible career growth opportunities, join us, and build real world value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;About the Cash Forecasting team:&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cash Forecasting&lt;/strong&gt; is our AI-amplified treasury solution that helps CFOs and treasury teams move beyond error-prone spreadsheets to achieve real-time cash visibility and predictive accuracy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The platform integrates seamlessly with major ERPs and banking systems to automatically capture, categorise, and analyse transactional data across multiple currencies and business units. Leveraging our proprietary GSmart AI technology, the solution continuously learns from historical cash flows, sales data, and treasury information to automatically select optimal forecasting algorithms and improve accuracy by over 30%.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work on sophisticated Ruby on Rails and React software that turns diverse financial data into clear analysis, giving customers sharp insight and forecasting through intuitive dashboards. This is a critical platform moving over $100 billion in daily cash flow for enterprise customers across 40+ countries, built to hold enterprise-grade security and scalability at that scale, every single day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and maintain backend services and APIs that power the Cash Forecasting platform, while remaining comfortable picking up frontend work when the task calls for it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across a large, sophisticated, multi-tenant SaaS codebase, writing code that&#39;s built to scale across enterprise customers and their data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the data layer, schema design, query performance, and data integrity - with a strong emphasis on PostgreSQL and SQL more broadly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write and maintain thorough test coverage using RSpec, treating testing as a first-class part of delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Package and deploy services using Docker, and work within our AWS-based cloud infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write scripts and tooling to automate repetitive work, support data migrations, and keep the team moving quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Instrument the systems you build with strong observability practices -logging, metrics, and tracing — to catch and resolve issues before they impact customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Benchmark and profile code to identify performance bottlenecks, and make evidence-based decisions about where to optimise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with product managers, designers, and fellow engineers to translate business and customer needs into robust technical solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in code reviews and technical design discussions, contributing to the team&#39;s overall growth and improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a champion of the YBIYRI ethos (you-build-it-you-run-it), which includes participating in the on-call pager rotation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring:&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4-8 years of professional software development experience, ideally including full-stack work with a backend lean&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong SQL fundamentals; hands-on experience with PostgreSQL ideal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working within large, sophisticated, existing codebases and making changes safely&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scripting ability for automation and tooling (language-agnostic)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Docker or other containerisation technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven Git proficiency, including collaborative branching workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in at least one major programming language (such as Ruby, Python, or Java)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience employing AI tools throughout the development lifecycle to speed up problem-solving and delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience testing with RSpec&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Preferred Knowledge / Experience:&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Ruby or Ruby on Rails is a strong plus - while we value the ability to learn quickly across languages, familiarity with our primary stack will help you ramp up faster.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frontend experience, ideally with React, and the ability to contribute there when needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with, or solid understanding of, AWS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or maintaining multi-tenant, enterprise SaaS platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with observability tooling and practices (logging, metrics, tracing, alerting)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience benchmarking and profiling code for performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in the financial industry, particularly treasury, payments, FX, or ERP systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO WE ARE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Do Your Best Work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The opportunity to build in a fast-paced start-up environment with experienced industry leaders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A learning environment where you can dive deep into the latest technologies and make an impact.&amp;nbsp; A professional development budget to support other modes of learning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Thrive in an environment where no matter what race, ethnicity, gender, origin, or culture they identify with, every employee is a respected, valued, and empowered part of the team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;In-office collaboration for moments that matter is important to our culture, and we give managers and teams the flexibility to decide which 10+ days a month they come in.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Bi-weekly all-company meeting - business updates and ask me anything style discussion with our Leadership Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We come together for moments that matter which include team offsites, team bonding activities, happy hours and more!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Take Control of Your Finances&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive salary, bonuses, and equity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive benefits that cover physical and mental healthcare, retirement, family forming, and family support&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Employee giving match&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Mobile phone stipend&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Take Care of Yourself&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;R&amp;amp;R days so you can rest and recharge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous wellness reimbursement and weekly onsite &amp;amp; virtual programming&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous vacation policy - work with your manager to take time off when you need it&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Industry-leading parental leave policies. Family planning benefits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Catered lunches, fully-stocked kitchens with premium snacks/beverages, and plenty of fun events&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Benefits listed above are for full-time employees.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ripple is an Equal Opportunity Employer. We’re committed to building a diverse and inclusive team. We do not discriminate against qualified employees or applicants because of race, color, religion, gender identity, sex, sexual identity, pregnancy, national origin, ancestry, citizenship, age, marital status, physical disability, mental disability, medical condition, military status, or any other characteristic protected by local law or ordinance.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please find our &lt;a href=&quot;https://ripple.com/legal/eu-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;UK/EU Applicant Privacy Notice &lt;/a&gt;and our &lt;a href=&quot;https://ripple.com/legal/ca-applicant-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;California Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; for reference.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-1x2pvxa:
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies - from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups - use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone&#39;s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our professional services team combines payments and financial expertise with experience integrating Stripe technology in thousands of projects. We help our customers create marketplaces, launch subscription businesses, expand globally, and more. This team provides critical implementation and post-launch services to help Stripe users maximize long-term value, quickly and confidently.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced Integration Engineer to join our SEA distributed team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe’s Integration Engineering team is responsible for providing technical leadership and guidance to our most strategic users while they are integrating with Stripe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re seeking engineers with strong technical and business skills to drive high-quality integrations while accelerating time-to-live. Using first-hand customer knowledge, you will also impact product strategy, working with all parts of Stripe to ensure its offerings continue to satisfy its largest and most strategic users’ needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a trusted technical advisor to clients and project members to solve complex technical challenges, and establish credibility &amp;amp; build deep relationships with senior technical individuals within client organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Collaborate with Sales, Solution Architecture and other user-facing teams to drive client engagement, customer wins, and revenue on behalf of the Professional Services team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and execute integration engineering end-to-end, from high-level architecture down to code implementation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being able to think on your feet and comfortable talking about technical concepts, and explaining how Stripe works, both from a product feature and API architecture perspective&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Educate our users and the developer community about Stripe&#39;s value proposition, best practices and new technical developments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the primary, ongoing technical point of contact for our largest users&#39; and partners&#39; technical teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep abreast of new Stripe technologies and software products and showcases technical thought leadership in whitepapers, conferences and other industry events&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Providing recommendations, feedback and best practices to the product and engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the development of Professional Services methodologies and tools to accelerate engagements and ease troubleshooting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 8+ years experience in an architecture (application, technical, systems, integration), technical consulting, process re-engineering or application delivery/technical engineering role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with various code-level debugging (Stripe code and user code)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be comfortable talking about technical concepts, and explaining how Stripe works, both from a product features and API architecture perspective.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with enterprise-level systems, including middleware, integrating with third-party APIs, and skills in systems flows, data/business object modeling, and use case/user interface production..&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A great verbal and written communicator, strong presentation skills, comfortable explaining complex technical concepts to both technical and non-technical audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrates a keen sense of ownership, drive, and entrepreneurship, thriving in fast-paced, dynamic environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional fluency in Mandarin Chinese and English is required for this role, as it involves working primarily with clients within the Greater China region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to accommodate light travel quarterly for customer on-sites and team meetings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Superior time management skills to manage multiple external customers simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-starter with the ability to assess, troubleshoot and work autonomously to decompose and solve complex problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to accommodate travel for customer on-sites and team meetings&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrives in a fast-paced, dynamic and collaborative environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to learn and teach others&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

