&lt;p&gt;We are looking to hire an experienced Oil and Refined Products Analyst or Trader to collaborate closely with our Trading team to build comprehensive supply/demand models and pricing models for major crude and distillate markets,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;contribute and generate actionable trading ideas and strategies.&lt;/p&gt;
